{"unit_id":"Castor6__dsh-auto-workspace#card-zh","repo":"Castor6/dsh-auto-workspace","commit":"fd2a73756a83c8c371f26002ce6961644c0f09bf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-workspace 是面向 DSH Web 的无项目会话插件。它为没有指定工作区或目录的新会话分配本机独立目录，并扩展新会话工作区选择器，支持退出项目；无项目会话继续新建时仍保持无项目，恢复时沿用原目录。目录按日期和序号组织，默认位于用户文档下的 DSH 目录，使用者可在加载配置中调整根目录和前缀。适合希望在不创建侧栏项目的情况下使用独立会话目录的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-20","lib/index.js:38-66","lib/client.js:13-19","lib/client.js:778-808","package.json:42-49"]}
{"unit_id":"Castor6__dsh-auto-workspace#card-en","repo":"Castor6/dsh-auto-workspace","commit":"fd2a73756a83c8c371f26002ce6961644c0f09bf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-workspace gives project-less DSH Web chats a local directory. Users can leave a project in the picker; later chats stay project-less and reopening reuses the directory. Directories are organized by date under Documents/DSH. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-20","lib/index.js:38-66","lib/client.js:13-19","lib/client.js:778-808","package.json:42-49"]}
